id=dumbdown_plan_unlock
name=DumbDown Plan Unlock
version=v1.2.0
versionCode=3
author=amber
description=Repairs the DumbDown Launcher's backend-dependent features at boot without modifying app code: (1) unlocks plan-gated tiles (has_subscription=true, hide_smart_txt/hide_audio_bundle=false) and (2) stops the always-failing boot SIM-check/activation screen (is_paired=true, device_registered=true, setup_skipped=true). It writes the app's own "activated/skipped" values into its prefs and null-routes the defunct backend so nothing can re-lock them. If the companion DumbDown Hide Smart Txt module is active, it writes hide_smart_txt=true instead.
